 "decision": {
  "selected": "O3b: low coil around the case above GM-09 (r 42->54 mm, 300 deg, z 62->45 mm, -6 PTFE/SS hose L 0.25 m) + engine riser 3/8 x 0.035 316 welded into a low inlet block at the head plug + fixed 3/8 line on the bay wall (corridor azimuths 142 / 218 deg are best; coil angle 300-330 deg sets the fixed-end azimuth; or outside the airframe), valve/tank interface directly above the engine zone",
  "why": "shortest vehicle: valve end at the zone top (~0.26 m above the pivot) instead of 0.215 + L cos(5.8 deg) + fittings for O1; K 0.6-7.8 N m/rad over EI 0.05-0.5 (meets K <= 20 at any EI in the assumed range, so the length does not depend on B-FD-1); M at 7 deg <= 0.95 N m; no rotating seal",
  "length_saved_m": {
   "vs_O1_as_adopted_L0.40": 0.38,
   "vs_O1_r22_L_max_wall": 0.25,
   "basis": "hose top fitting + 0.03 m vs the zone-top valve station 0.26 m; ESTIMATE"
  },
  "O1_finding": "the adopted O1 rule (radial line, L >= 0.40 m) does not fit the 140 mm bay with the inlet at r 22 mm: the 3 mm wall rule caps L at 0.27 m (neutral -0.2 / stop -3.5 mm at L 0.40), and K <= 20 at EI 0.5 needs L >= 0.373 m -> O1 at r 22 works only if B-FD-1 shows EI <= ~0.25 N m2; with the inlet at r 15 mm L_max is 0.50 m",
  "gates": [
   "G1 Combustion accepts the low inlet (annulus + 3 mm passage, manifold +1.2 cm3 ESTIMATE to ~4.5 of the 5 cm3 target, single-side entry)",
   "G2 CAD v3.4: plug/case +3..+8 mm for the annulus/gland, stepped inlet block, riser and coil modelled and swept at all 9 poses + the 8 deg cone",
   "G3 v3.4 HV69 stack keeps r <= 22.5 mm within +/-15 deg of the fixed-line azimuth over z 215-252 mm (else 1/4 in line, groove or external line)",
   "G4 hose datasheet: minimum (dynamic) bend radius <= 39 mm at -6, temperature rating covering a 136-178 C case 3-15 mm away (B1 hi bound), O2-clean PTFE; B-FD-1 measures K pressurised on the coil",
   "G5 thermal: riser/hose share the trapped-liquid relief requirement (valve closed in coasts); shield or wrap where the riser passes the pre-chamber (case OD up to 312 C at the hi bound)"
  ],
  "fallback": "O1 with the inlet moved to r <= 15 mm (L 0.37-0.50 m, valve end ~0.6 m) or O1 at r 22 with L = 0.27 m if B-FD-1 gives EI <= 0.25 N m2",
  "rejected": {
   "O2 helix at the stack top": "K 27-132 N m/rad at EI 0.25-0.5, installed bend radius 5.5 mm, wall/engine interference",
   "O5 inverted U above the stack": "K 32-156 N m/rad at EI 0.25-0.5, wall interference 30-50 mm",
   "O3a riser to the bonnet-top inlet": "riser cannot pass the bonnet/head inside the sweep (-2.1 to -6.6 mm)",
   "O4 rotary unions": "rotating seals in liquid N2O at 7 MPa, no qualified part, no length saving without an airframe channel"
